    <div class="callout"><p>Coffee gets you up. The drop brings you down. The second coffee pushes you back up. Then you spend the rest of the afternoon managing the push.</p></div>
    <p>It is not that coffee is evil. It is that you keep asking the same tool to solve two different problems.</p>
    <p>One cup to start the day.</p>
    <p>Another cup to recover the day.</p>
    <p>Then another one because the second cup did not give you the kind of afternoon you wanted.</p>
    <figure>
